[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0481","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0481.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13306","title":"Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home USB认证绕过漏洞","description":"Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 电动汽车充电桩的 USB 接口存在认证绕过漏洞。该设备暴露的 USB 接口在访问功能前未进行身份验证，物理接触攻击者可通过连接 USB 设备直接绕过系统认证机制，获取设备管理权限。该漏洞影响 Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 系列产品，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。攻击者需物理接触目标设备方可利用，无需任何认证。厂商已在固件版本 V1.40.81 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13306"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 的固件升级至 V1.40.81 或更高版本。升级路径：通过设备管理界面或 Autel 官方应用检查并安装固件更新。如无法立即升级，应限制对充电桩 USB 接口的物理访问，将设备部署在受控区域，防止未授权人员接触 USB 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/f4fa13677cfb779d11c65819551d752402c8b4a2/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-434.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/67e7c8e99992c9a46d801dc18838a34675b567ae/news/2026/07/2026-07-15.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0481.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0479","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0479.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13305","title":"Microsoft Windows TCP/IP 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Autel 电动汽车充电器（MaxiCharger AC Elite Home）软件更新过程中的数字签名验证严重不足，导致未经身份验证的物理访问者可以执行任意代码。攻击者无需密码即可提供恶意软件更新镜像，系统在验证过程中出现漏洞，允许恶意代码注入。该漏洞影响范围广泛，任何普通用户均可通过物理接触充电设备触发攻击，由于无需身份验证，风险尤为严重。攻击者可以利用此漏洞完全接管充电系统，甚至扩展到电动汽车的安全控制层面。微软已发布 V1.40.81 固件版本以修复此安全缺陷，但用户仍需手动升级以确保安全。 CVSS 评分 6.4，危险等级中等（6.4 适用于中等风险），漏洞影响多方面，包含多个高危点，需立即修复","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13305"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Autel MaxiCharger AC Elite Home 固件升级至 V1.40.81 或更高版本，该版本修复了软件更新签名验证缺陷。升级前确保充电器连接至可信网络，避免使用公共充电桩提供的固件更新。若暂时无法升级，应禁止非授权人员物理接触设备，并禁用设备的远程固件更新功能，仅通过 Autel 官方应用程序和受信任的网络进行固件更新操作。建议定期检查 Autel 官网或 Autel Energy 应用中的固件更新通知。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/f4fa13677cfb779d11c65819551d752402c8b4a2/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-433.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/67e7c8e99992c9a46d801dc18838a34675b567ae/news/2026/07/2026-07-15.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0479.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0478","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0478.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54087","title":"EasyCorp EasyAdmin 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"EasyAdmin 后台管理面板的 FileField 和 ImageField 字段默认接受浏览器可执行文件类型（FileField 无 MIME/扩展名限制，ImageField 的 Image 约束接受 SVG 格式）。当上传目录配置在 Web 公开可访问路径下时，攻击者可通过具有上传权限的账户上传包含恶意 JavaScript 的 .html 或 .svg 文件。其他管理员在后台访问该文件时，由于文件与后台同源，恶意脚本将在认证会话上下文中执行，导致会话令牌窃取、CSRF 令牌泄露或权限提升。该漏洞为存储型 XSS，需开发者将上传目录置于公开路径且存在上传者与查看者之间的权限差才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54087","GHSA-8559-gwj3-q37r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 easycorp/easyadmin-bundle 升级到 v5.0.13 或更高版本（composer require easycorp/easyadmin-bundle:^5.0.13），该版本默认对 .html/.svg 等危险文件类型强制下载而非内联渲染。如无法立即升级，可在 Nginx/Apache 中为上传目录配置 Content-Disposition: attachment 响应头，或将上传目录移至 public 目录之外。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bdad617141bf94fdd6b5d7555334d5b3677fca78/2026/CVE-2026-54087.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/packagist/easycorp/easyadmin-bundle/CVE-2026-54087.yml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-8559-gwj3-q37r/GHSA-8559-gwj3-q37r.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/1fe4cfd6cf59fa2fa3e612ecc32493de51f1f6f2/posts/cve-2026-54087-composer-easycorp-easyadmin-bundle.html","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54087.json","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/dce39ef8dd24743d0eb60b36b80f49d51f219690/data/history/CVE-2026-54087.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29754.yaml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/1fe4cfd6cf59fa2fa3e612ecc32493de51f1f6f2/api/intel/products/cve-2026-54087-composer-easycorp-easyadmin-bundle.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/1fe4cfd6cf59fa2fa3e612ecc32493de51f1f6f2/posts/cve-2026-49273-composer-mantisbt-mantisbt.html","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/1fe4cfd6cf59fa2fa3e612ecc32493de51f1f6f2/posts/cve-2026-61549-go-go-woodpecker-ci-org-woodpecker-v3.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0478.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0477","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0477.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13268","title":"G DATA Total Security 备份服务符号链接跟随本地权限提升漏洞","description":"G DATA Total Security 的备份服务（Backup Service）存在符号链接跟随漏洞（CWE-59: Improper Link Resolution Before File Access）。本地攻击者首先需要在目标系统上获得低权限代码执行能力，然后通过创建恶意的符号链接，利用备份服务以 SYSTEM 权限删除任意文件，最终实现权限提升并在 SYSTEM 上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 G DATA Total Security 版本 25.5.20.121 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。厂商已在 25.5.20.121 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13268"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 G DATA Total Security 升级至 25.5.20.121 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可限制低权限用户对 Backup Service 相关目录的写入权限，并监控符号链接创建行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/f4fa13677cfb779d11c65819551d752402c8b4a2/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-432.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/67e7c8e99992c9a46d801dc18838a34675b567ae/news/2026/07/2026-07-15.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0477.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0476","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0476.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54077","title":"ArcadeData ArcadeDB 数据库导入功能服务器端请求伪造与任意文件读取漏洞","description":"ArcadeDB 数据库的 IMPORT DATABASE SQL 语句未正确校验用户权限与输入来源，任何具备 SQL 命令访问权限的认证用户（非仅 root 管理员）均可利用该漏洞实施两类攻击：一是服务端请求伪造（SSRF），通过构造 HTTP/HTTPS 协议的导入源 URL，诱使服务器向任意目标（包括云元数据端点 169.254.169.254 及内网服务）发起请求并将响应内容导入为可查询记录；二是任意本地文件读取，通过 file:// 协议路径读取服务器进程可访问的本地文件（如 /etc/passwd、凭据文件等），将其内容暴露为数据库记录。此外，XML 导入器未禁用 DTD 处理，存在实体扩展攻击（Billion Laughs）风险。攻击者仅需拥有数据库的 SQL 查询权限即可触发，无需管理员角色。该漏洞影响 ArcadeDB 所有版本，官方已在 PR #4422 中修复，修复措施包括：将 IMPORT DATABASE 权限提升至 updateSecurity 级别、对 HTTP(S) 导入源进行网络地址黑名单校验（默认阻止回环/链路本地/私有地址）、增加本地路径白名单配置、禁用 XML DTD 处理。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54077","GHSA-8w86-m9h8-hvqg"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级至包含 PR #4422 修复的 ArcadeDB 版本（≥ 提交 4422），该修复要求 IMPORT DATABASE 操作需具备 updateSecurity 权限，并默认阻止对回环/私有地址的 HTTP 请求。如无法升级，严格限制 SQL 命令/查询端点的访问权限，仅授予受信管理用户，并禁止向不可信用户开放查询接口。同时检查 arcadedb.server.security.importBlockLocalNetworks 配置项确保为 true。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bdad617141bf94fdd6b5d7555334d5b3677fca78/2026/CVE-2026-54077.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/maven/com.arcadedb/arcadedb-engine/CVE-2026-54077.yml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/1fe4cfd6cf59fa2fa3e612ecc32493de51f1f6f2/cve/CVE-2026-54077.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-8w86-m9h8-hvqg/GHSA-8w86-m9h8-hvqg.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54077.json","https://github.com/JimBLogic/CyberDailyLog/blob/98e56ea25f36fdfe6e855955b7a08d4f4ed26469/reports/archive/2026/07/2026-07-17.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29874.yaml","https://github.com/JsHuang/sec-advisory-daily/blob/86aea41dd2762b8ae57edf00dafe081b4536e32d/reports/report-2026-07-17.html","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/1fe4cfd6cf59fa2fa3e612ecc32493de51f1f6f2/api/intel/products/cve-2026-54077-maven-com-arcadedb-arcadedb-engine.json","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/dce39ef8dd24743d0eb60b36b80f49d51f219690/data/history/CVE-2026-54077.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0476.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0475","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0475.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13135","title":"Synology DiskStation DS925+ MailPlus Redis 实例不当暴露漏洞","description":"Synology DiskStation DS925+ 的 MailPlus 组件存在通信通道未正确限制漏洞。该漏洞源于 MailPlus 防火墙规则配置缺陷，导致 Redis 实例意外通过 IPv6 协议暴露在网络上。网络相邻的未认证攻击者可利用此漏洞直接访问 Redis 实例，获取敏感信息（如缓存数据、会话密钥等），并可能结合其他漏洞实现以 root 权限执行任意代码。攻击者无需任何认证即可发起攻击，攻击复杂度低。Synology 已发布安全公告 Synology_SA_26_11 修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13135"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Synology MailPlus Server 升级至以下修复版本：DSM 7.3 升级至 4.0.1-31663 及以上，DSM 7.2.1/7.2.2 升级至 4.0.1-21663 及以上。如无法立即升级，可在网络防火墙层面禁用 IPv6 访问，或限制对 Redis 端口（6379）的访问仅允许受信 IP 段，以降低被相邻网络攻击者利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/f4fa13677cfb779d11c65819551d752402c8b4a2/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/f61d3a0442366484590d4dce01d0bce8dce34a4a/2026/07/2026-07-01-report.md","https://github.com/fr4nsyz/wiredIn/blob/0a5d2314fe12a84a503ef8047307a2eb7f4ae51a/today's%20greatest","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-424.json","https://github.com/f-peng/f-peng.github.io/blob/1980f700f68bebbfeaeaefe6fc3564cb8323c765/content/cyber/blog_2026-07-02.md","https://github.com/dedsec-terminal/dedsec-terminal.github.io/blob/6b0554bdfdb9df7944733bf9d2c64bef3b0360a1/content/posts/synologyissuescriticalfixformailplusservervulnerabilities.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/synology/2026/07/VW-2026-18693.yaml","https://github.com/gcp-lopo/hacker-news-ai-pages/blob/6c0af2943181bc436cdeed89298f84071e0e9ecf/archives/2026-06-30/index.html","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/67e7c8e99992c9a46d801dc18838a34675b567ae/news/2026/06/2026-06-26.json","https://github.com/fr4nsyz/wiredIn/blob/0a5d2314fe12a84a503ef8047307a2eb7f4ae51a/GREATEST_README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0475.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0474","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0474.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54076","title":"ArcadeDB 数据库模式授权绕过漏洞","description":"ArcadeDB 数据库引擎在修复 CVE-2026-44221 时仅对 `LocalDocumentType.createProperty` 方法添加了 `UPDATE_SCHEMA` 权限检查，但遗漏了 `DROP PROPERTY`、`ALTER TYPE`（修改继承层级、重命名类型）、`ALTER PROPERTY`（修改字段属性）等多个公开的 Schema 变更方法。已认证的身份（包括只读 API 令牌）即使不具备 `UPDATE_SCHEMA` 权限，仍可通过数据库命令/查询的 HTTP 端点发送 SQL DDL 语句来篡改数据库 Schema，破坏已存储记录的数据语义，并违反 ArcadeDB 文档中声明的权限模型。该漏洞不影响嵌入式模式及系统上下文（如启动时 Schema 加载、HA 复制应用）中的内部路径和管理员操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54076","GHSA-vg6x-6pg9-6qwg"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 ArcadeDB 依赖 com.arcadedb:arcadedb-engine 升级至 26.6.1 或更高版本，该版本已对 LocalDocumentType 和 LocalProperty 所有公开的 schema 变更方法强制执行 UPDATE_SCHEMA 权限检查。Maven 项目修改 pom.xml 中版本号为 26.6.1 后重新构建即可。若暂时无法升级，应在应用层将所有 schema DDL 操作（DROP PROPERTY、ALTER TYPE、ALTER PROPERTY 等）限制为管理员身份执行，并对非可信用户和 API Token 仅授予读取权限，禁止授予写入访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/67be355b2024cf650191c9c4ccd0c55290fa0eef/2026/CVE-2026-54076.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/maven/com.arcadedb/arcadedb-engine/CVE-2026-54076.yml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/dc991ecc7d18138059b131976b908c4d198abe92/cve/CVE-2026-54076.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-vg6x-6pg9-6qwg/GHSA-vg6x-6pg9-6qwg.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54076.json","https://github.com/JimBLogic/CyberDailyLog/blob/98e56ea25f36fdfe6e855955b7a08d4f4ed26469/reports/archive/2026/07/2026-07-17.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29875.yaml","https://github.com/JsHuang/sec-advisory-daily/blob/86aea41dd2762b8ae57edf00dafe081b4536e32d/reports/report-2026-07-17.html","https://github.com/rinz0x0cruz/exploitrank/blob/dce39ef8dd24743d0eb60b36b80f49d51f219690/data/history/CVE-2026-54076.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/dc991ecc7d18138059b131976b908c4d198abe92/api/intel/products/cve-2026-54076-maven-com-arcadedb-arcadedb-engine.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0474.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0474.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0474.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0471","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0471.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54072","title":"Authorizer OAuth2 authorize 端点重定向验证绕过漏洞","description":"Authorizer 的 /authorize 端点未对 redirect_uri 参数进行来源校验，攻击者可构造恶意链接将受害者重定向至攻击者控制的 URL，导致 access_token、id_token 和 refresh_token 等 OAuth2 凭证通过 URL 查询参数泄露。攻击者无需认证即可从公开的 /graphql 接口获取 client_id，诱使已登录用户点击恶意链接后即可窃取令牌并完全冒充受害者身份。该漏洞影响 Authorizer 所有版本，v2.0.1 仅修复了其他处理函数但遗漏了 /authorize 端点。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54072","GHSA-h29v-hj44-q8cv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Authorizer 到 v2.0.2 或更高版本（v2.0.1 仅修复了 oauth_login 等处理器，/authorize 端点的修复在后续版本中完成）。如暂时无法升级，应在 /authorize 端点的 redirect_uri 参数处理处手动添加校验：在 internal/http_handlers/authorize.go 中，读取 redirect_uri 后立即调用 validators.IsValidOrigin(redirectURI, h.Config.AllowedOrigins)，若校验失败则返回 400 错误并终止请求。可通过反向代理（Nginx/Caddy）层面对 /authorize 路径的 redirect_uri 参数进行白名单过滤作为临时缓解措施，仅允许 redirect_uri 指向已配置的 AllowedOrigins 域名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/67be355b2024cf650191c9c4ccd0c55290fa0eef/2026/CVE-2026-54072.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/go/github.com/authorizerdev/authorizer/CVE-2026-54072.yml","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/osv/GO-2026-5959.json","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/0262d64737c11a639346262c413e84b552ac0aa6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-54072-authorizer-unvalidated-redirect-uri-in-authorize-leaks-oauth2-tokens-to-attacker-controlled-url.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-h29v-hj44-q8cv/GHSA-h29v-hj44-q8cv.json","https://github.com/bmwiedemann/openSUSE/blob/d8a287381c78b37aa3d10fca316ba2301f060da3/packages/g/govulncheck-vulndb/govulncheck-vulndb.changes","https://github.com/anajuliabit/aeon/blob/72fb168bd0249c8b531b6fd4af3fa70a07a4ebd9/memory/logs/2026-07-11.md","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54072.json","https://github.com/JsHuang/sec-advisory-daily/blob/86aea41dd2762b8ae57edf00dafe081b4536e32d/reports/report-2026-07-11.html","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29647.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0471.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0469","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0469.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54071","title":"funstory-ai BabelDOC CMap Pickle反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"BabelDOC 的 PDF 解析器（babeldoc/pdfminer/cmapdb.py）在处理 CMap 文件时存在不安全的 pickle 反序列化漏洞。`_load_data()` 方法仅过滤了空字节，未对 PDF 中的 CMap 名称进行路径合法性校验。攻击者可通过在 PDF 的 /Encoding 名称中使用 #xx 十六进制编码注入绝对路径（如 /#2Ftmp#2Fattacker#2Fevil），利用 Python os.path.join() 在遇到绝对路径时丢弃前置目录参数的特性，将反序列化重定向到攻击者可控的 .pickle.gz 文件。处理特制 PDF 后，pickle.loads() 将执行任意 Python 代码，导致完全控制 BabelDOC 进程权限。该漏洞影响 BabelDOC 0.6.3 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击者需在目标系统上放置恶意 pickle 文件（如 /tmp/ 目录），并诱导用户处理恶意 PDF 文件。厂商已在 0.6.3 版本中通过清单白名单、路径包含检查和 SHA-256 完整性校验修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54071","GHSA-m8gf-v64p-gfmg"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 BabelDOC 至 0.6.3 或更高版本，该版本移除了 CMAP_PATH 环境变量支持并增加了 CMap 文件白名单校验和完整性检查。如无法立即升级，请勿设置 CMAP_PATH 环境变量，仅处理受信任来源的 PDF 文件，并使用低权限账户运行 BabelDOC 进程。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/funstory-ai/BabelDOC/blob/17480db9df92ddcb37349ce34b312335226e8ec9/docs/release-notes/v0.6.3.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/BabelDOC/CVE-2026-54071.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c780af27018f76bd0195fdc212762a2b428fde08/2026/CVE-2026-54071.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/dc991ecc7d18138059b131976b908c4d198abe92/cve/CVE-2026-54071.html","https://github.com/YANG-Haruka/LinguaHaru/blob/3f54ef69dadb5fd4e054658f9a023bacada196d8/core/translators/pdf_translator.py","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/0262d64737c11a639346262c413e84b552ac0aa6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-54071-babeldoc-arbitrary-code-execution-via-cmap-pickle-deserialization-in-babeldoc-pdfminer-cmapdb-py.md","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3926520bcc5671ddd00549bf2242a2082ef49d3d/vulns/babeldoc/PYSEC-2026-2389.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-m8gf-v64p-gfmg/GHSA-m8gf-v64p-gfmg.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54071.json","https://github.com/anajuliabit/aeon/blob/72fb168bd0249c8b531b6fd4af3fa70a07a4ebd9/memory/topics/fleet.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0469.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0466","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0466.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-12357","title":"Heimdall Data Database Proxy CRLF注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Heimdall Data Database Proxy 的 generateFileContent 函数存在 CRLF 注入漏洞，经过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该函数提交特制的 CRLF 序列载荷，利用缺乏有效过滤的缺陷注入恶意内容，最终实现以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Heimdall Data Database Proxy 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。厂商已在 25.03.01.24 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-12357"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Heimdall Data Database Proxy 至 release build 25.03.01.24（2026年2月28日发布）或更高版本。该版本已修复 generateFileContent 函数中的 CRLF 注入问题。临时缓解措施：严格限制管理界面访问权限，仅允许受信 IP 和用户登录，因为该漏洞需要管理员权限才能利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/cd596f71c1d797aa83acf6f397dce73c3da6e7ca/reports/2026/07/intel--1784857063_CVE-2026-12357_CVE-2026-16804_CVE-2026-2.html","https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/f4fa13677cfb779d11c65819551d752402c8b4a2/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/08e33a39d1e95721663e52308f7f1c2599c0ac4c/2026/07/2026-07-24-report.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-447.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cve_news/blob/67e7c8e99992c9a46d801dc18838a34675b567ae/news/2026/07/2026-07-23.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/cd596f71c1d797aa83acf6f397dce73c3da6e7ca/reports/2026/07/intel--ca643ae310c36b559b2c2492.html","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/CYBERDUDEBIVASH-THREAT-INTEL-PLATFORM/blob/cd596f71c1d797aa83acf6f397dce73c3da6e7ca/data/stix/CDB-APEX-1784857063.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0466.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0466.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0458","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0458.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54065","title":"NukeViet 评论管理功能路径遍历致任意文件删除漏洞","description":"NukeViet 后台评论编辑功能中存在路径遍历漏洞，允许经过身份验证的管理员通过注入特制的 `attach` 参数删除应用根目录下的任意文件（如 `config.php`）。漏洞位于 `modules/comment/admin/edit.php` 文件中，由于程序在处理 `attach` 参数时仅通过 `substr()` 截取固定前缀长度，未对路径进行合法性校验，攻击者可填充 26 个任意字符后拼接 `../../` 路径遍历序列将目标文件路径存入数据库。当评论被删除时，`del.php` 从数据库中读取该路径并调用 `nv_deletefile()` 执行删除操作，该函数仅检查路径是否在 `NV_ROOTDIR` 范围内，未限制删除目录为上传目录，导致任意文件被删除。攻击者利用此漏洞可删除 `config.php` 导致应用完全不可用并暴露安装向导，造成严重业务中断。CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高，影响 NukeViet 多个版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54065","GHSA-c9xg-64p9-f2jj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 NukeViet 至包含该修复的版本（≥ 4.5.03），修复在 `modules/comment/admin/edit.php` 中增加了 `nv_is_file()` 路径校验，拒绝包含 `../` 的 `attach` 参数。如无法立即升级，可临时移除管理员对评论编辑功能的访问权限，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截包含 `attach=*../` 模式的 POST 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/packagist/nukeviet/nukeviet/CVE-2026-54065.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2d169092e150510565286f993df9f7fc48f36f74/2026/CVE-2026-54065.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/f8742da1084e2ea91d8a187f05ac4aefa8a39934/cve/CVE-2026-54065.html","https://github.com/nukeviet/nukeviet/blob/aa109b6683cd35d74b1f3028ff53bff426ed1d5d/CHANGELOG.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-c9xg-64p9-f2jj/GHSA-c9xg-64p9-f2jj.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54065.json","https://github.com/mindyoumh/my-ailounge/blob/d8c84c82ad390de87727e202006aa179880ba61b/docs/feeds/08-security-alerts.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29707.yaml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/f8742da1084e2ea91d8a187f05ac4aefa8a39934/api/intel/products/cve-2026-54065-composer-nukeviet-nukeviet.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/f8742da1084e2ea91d8a187f05ac4aefa8a39934/posts/cve-2026-54065-composer-nukeviet-nukeviet.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0458.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0456","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0456.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54064","title":"NukeViet 新闻模块存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"NukeViet CMS 的新闻模块存在两处反 XSS 过滤器绕过漏洞。`filterAttr()` 方法未过滤 ASCII 进纸符（`\\x0C`），攻击者可在事件处理属性名前添加 `\\x0C` 绕过 `/^on/` 正则检测；`unhtmlentities()` 方法未过滤十进制 HTML 实体 `&#9;`，可在 `javascript:` URI 中插入 `&#9;` 绕过关键词过滤。拥有新闻发布权限的低权限用户可在文章中注入持久化 JavaScript，当管理员或其他用户访问受影响页面时触发，导致会话劫持、凭据窃取、权限提升等严重后果。厂商已在 commit 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54064","GHSA-465g-4q99-5x86"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 nukeviet/nukeviet 升级至 4.6.00 及以上版本。该版本在 vendor/vinades/nukeviet/Core/Request.php 中修复了 filterAttr() 方法（在属性名前过滤 \\x00-\\x20 控制字符）和 unhtmlentities() 方法（过滤十进制 HTML 实体编码的控制字符）。由于无临时缓解措施，必须升级才能彻底修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/packagist/nukeviet/nukeviet/CVE-2026-54064.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2d169092e150510565286f993df9f7fc48f36f74/2026/CVE-2026-54064.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/3b5728f00ee558b9c845d4d9a20f2a9004619429/cve/CVE-2026-54064.html","https://github.com/nukeviet/nukeviet/blob/aa109b6683cd35d74b1f3028ff53bff426ed1d5d/CHANGELOG.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-465g-4q99-5x86/GHSA-465g-4q99-5x86.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-54064.json","https://github.com/mindyoumh/my-ailounge/blob/d8c84c82ad390de87727e202006aa179880ba61b/docs/feeds/08-security-alerts.md","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29706.yaml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/3b5728f00ee558b9c845d4d9a20f2a9004619429/api/intel/products/cve-2026-54064-composer-nukeviet-nukeviet.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/3b5728f00ee558b9c845d4d9a20f2a9004619429/posts/cve-2026-54064-composer-nukeviet-nukeviet.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0456.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0447","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0447.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53956","title":"Rattler conda 包缓存路径遍历漏洞","description":"Rattler 是一款 conda 包管理工具，其 rattler_cache 和 py-rattler 组件在处理 conda 频道元数据时存在路径遍历漏洞。攻击者可通过恶意或不可信的 conda 频道发布包含路径分隔符或遍历组件的 build 字符串，在缓存物化过程中，该字符串被拼接为文件系统路径的一部分，导致包内容被写入配置的包缓存目录之外。该漏洞影响使用 rattler 处理不可信 conda 频道的用户，可能导致任意文件写入。建议用户升级至修复版本并避免使用不可信 conda 频道。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53956","GHSA-h672-p7h7-97v9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 rattler_cache 升级至 0.9.0 及以上版本，将 py-rattler 升级至 0.24.0 及以上版本。同时仅使用经过审核的官方 conda 频道（如 conda-forge、defaults），避免添加不可信或来源不明的第三方频道，并在 conda 配置中限制频道白名单。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/py-rattler/CVE-2026-53956.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9a744405af9963b75806fc17a6bfddc39223f336/2026/CVE-2026-53956.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3926520bcc5671ddd00549bf2242a2082ef49d3d/vulns/py-rattler/PYSEC-2026-2970.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-h672-p7h7-97v9/GHSA-h672-p7h7-97v9.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-53956.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/433650e81dc87b0e7eebc5f102c8077f8f1019a0/data/osv-cargo.purl","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29625.yaml","https://github.com/YSheldon/0dayWatchDog/blob/0e3ef1cf03c820e8453cc6310c4599aba5b555ee/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-07-10_03-38-12/vulnerability_report_2026-07-10_03-38-12.md","https://github.com/bitfront-se/vuln-list-temp/blob/f637a1d9c477b365f04814609a546f50c9aa4193/osv/python/py-rattler/PYSEC-2026-2970.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/433650e81dc87b0e7eebc5f102c8077f8f1019a0/data/ghsa-cargo.purl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0447.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0445","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0445.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53932","title":"wnx laravel-backup-restore 数据库恢复过程操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"laravel-backup-restore 数据库恢复功能存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。该漏洞源于恢复流程在解压 ZIP 备份归档后，将 `db-dumps` 目录下的文件名直接拼接到 shell 命令字符串中（如 `mysql ... < {dumpFile}`、`gunzip -c {dumpFile}`、`psql ... < {dumpFile}`），而未对文件名进行 shell 转义处理。由于 `Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Process::run(string)` 底层使用 Symfony `Process::fromShellCommandline()`，文件名中的 shell 元字符会被 `/bin/sh` 或 Windows 平台 shell 解释执行。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意文件名的备份归档，诱导管理员或自动化系统恢复该归档，从而以 PHP/Laravel 应用用户的身份执行任意系统命令，导致应用被控制、数据库凭据泄露、数据篡改及横向移动。该漏洞影响 `wnx/laravel-backup-restore` 包 v1.9.4 之前的所有版本，已在 v1.9.4 中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53932","GHSA-w9mx-xmg4-gc4r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 wnx/laravel-backup-restore 升级至 v1.9.4 及以上版本，该版本已修复数据库恢复过程中 ZIP 条目文件名未转义导致的命令注入问题。由于无配置缓解措施，升级是唯一完整的修复方案，请勿对不可信来源的备份归档执行恢复操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/YHalo-wyh/security-research/blob/4834c2bacee5487f27cb419f0122428e4158a71c/cves/CVE-2026-53932.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9a744405af9963b75806fc17a6bfddc39223f336/2026/CVE-2026-53932.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/packagist/wnx/laravel-backup-restore/CVE-2026-53932.yml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/2f177ebb4b5452c2c02ca5859b2ea631fa7d5bc4/cve/CVE-2026-53932.html","https://github.com/stevologic/security-recipes.ai/blob/0262d64737c11a639346262c413e84b552ac0aa6/content/recipes/cve/cve-2026-53932-laravel-backup-restore-has-an-os-command-injection-during-database-restore.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-w9mx-xmg4-gc4r/GHSA-w9mx-xmg4-gc4r.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-53932.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29607.yaml","https://github.com/JsHuang/sec-advisory-daily/blob/86aea41dd2762b8ae57edf00dafe081b4536e32d/reports/report-2026-07-10.html","https://github.com/YHalo-wyh/security-research/blob/4834c2bacee5487f27cb419f0122428e4158a71c/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0445.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0444","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0444.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53769","title":"Avo 附件上传接口缺失服务端上传授权导致字段级上传策略绕过漏洞","description":"Avo（Ruby on Rails 管理后台框架）的直接附件上传端点缺少服务端上传授权校验，绕过文档中定义的字段级上传策略方法（如 `upload_{FIELD_ID}?`）。已认证的 Avo 用户可直接向 `/avo_api/resources/:resource_name/:id/attachments/` 端点发送 POST 请求，在 `update?` 和 `upload_<field>?` 策略均拒绝操作的情况下，仍能替换或添加目标记录的附件内容（包括二进制文件、文件名和 Content-Type 元数据）。该漏洞源于 `AttachmentsController#create` 方法在创建 `ActiveStorage::Blob` 之前未调用 `authorize_action` 进行上传授权，与删除操作的授权实现不一致。影响 Avo >= 2.28.0 版本，主要危害多角色部署场景中非管理员用户可绕过字段级上传限制，替换受保护的附件字段。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53769","GHSA-pqpw-cvm4-8mv9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"目前官方尚未发布修复版本。建议持续关注 Avo 官方更新，升级到包含修复的版本。临时缓解措施：(1) 确保仅完全受信任的管理员可访问 Avo 路由；(2) 通过 monkey-patch 重写 `Avo::AttachmentsController#create` 方法，在 `ActiveStorage::Blob.create_and_upload!` 之前执行上传授权检查，对 key-based/Trix 上传流回退到 `update?` 策略判断；(3) 在反向代理层对 `/avo_api/resources/*/attachments/` 路径实施额外的访问控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/6abafa39bbf76fbd32a01a93a3a2ba048c0f7143/gems/avo/CVE-2026-53769.yml","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/7fe93c0d9f67491f32ca61e33aaca423a4c19903/advisories/_posts/2026-06-02-CVE-2026-53769.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/754919a35927468aab0f829e479fb581738773fd/2026/CVE-2026-53769.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/gem/avo/CVE-2026-53769.yml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-pqpw-cvm4-8mv9/GHSA-pqpw-cvm4-8mv9.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/consensus-engine/blob/dcd526fb689714d5f3e3864d909b86e28c091c65/docs/data/2026/CVE-2026-53769.json","https://github.com/maxgfr/package-checker.sh/blob/433650e81dc87b0e7eebc5f102c8077f8f1019a0/data/ghsa-gem.purl","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/vulndb/vulns/github/2026/07/VW-2026-29608.yaml","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/2f177ebb4b5452c2c02ca5859b2ea631fa7d5bc4/ai-security-intel-memory.json","https://github.com/proshiba/vuln-intel-agent/blob/eb9d5949573bf98755141185e45226827196e91c/data/vendors/github/advisories/2026/ghsa-pqpw-cvm4-8mv9/advisory.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0444.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0444.toml"}]